  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2022-04-15** (recommended): source not stated; 7 songs; 50 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- This was the uploader's third King Gizzard show, following two 2017 Coachella afternoon sets [1]\n- Unlike the 2017 afternoon performances, this set closed the festival at midnight [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2022-04-15**: taped by themojavetent; transferred by themojavetent; source: SP-CMC-8 (w/Mods) [1]. Also: Recorded on Sony PCM-M10, processed in Adobe Audition, and encoded to FLAC [1]",
